# Assignment tracker, gradebook and AI queue checks (the Admin UI backend), run with the
# VS Code REST Client extension. Start the server (./mvnw spring-boot:run) with the README's
# .env defaults, then send the blocks top to bottom: later blocks reuse ids from earlier ones.
#
# REST Client keeps the jwt_java_spring cookie, so each "Log in" block switches the caller:
#   toby = admin (CRUD + tracker), hop = student (submit, own grades, permission checks).
# Expected status is in each block's title.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8585
@adminUid = toby
@adminPassword = 123Toby!
@studentUid = hop
@studentPassword = 123Grace!

### ---------- Anonymous: everything below needs a login ----------

### Anonymous tracker -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/tracker

### Anonymous gradebook roster -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students

### Anonymous AI queue -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue

### ---------- Admin (toby): assignment CRUD + tracker ----------

### Log in as admin -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "{{adminUid}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### CREATE a throwaway [TEST] assignment (text, 1 point, due in a week) -> 201
# @name testAssignment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/test

@assignmentId = {{testAssignment.response.body.$.id}}

### READ it back by id -> 200, body is the name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}

### READ it in the tracker list (submissionCount / ungradedCount / pendingAiCount / rubricReady) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/tracker

### Run the tracker's health checks -> 200, one {check, ok, message} per check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/checks

### UPDATE details -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "[TEST] HTTP renamed",
  "type": "test",
  "description": "Edited from api/assignments_gradebook.http",
  "points": 2,
  "dueDate": "12/31/2026",
  "assignmentType": "text"
}

### UPDATE with 0 points -> 200 today, although /checks then reports "Points must be greater than 0"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "[TEST] HTTP renamed",
  "type": "test",
  "points": 0,
  "dueDate": "12/31/2026"
}

### Put the points back -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "[TEST] HTTP renamed",
  "type": "test",
  "points": 1,
  "dueDate": "12/31/2026"
}

### Set a rubric by hand -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/ai-rubric
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rubric": "0.9: complete and correct\n0.5: partially complete\n0.0: missing"
}

### Blank rubric -> 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/ai-rubric
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rubric": "  "
}

### Checks on a missing assignment -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/999999999/checks

### Gradebook course tabs as staff -> 200 (rows per student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students?course=CSA

### Gradebook with an unknown course -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students?course=BOGUS

### Gradebook "no class" tab -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students?course=NONE

### Full AI queue as staff -> 200 (running, nextRunInSeconds, queueLength, entries)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue

### ---------- Student (hop): submit, read own grades, permission checks ----------

### Log in as student -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "{{studentUid}}",
  "password": "{{studentPassword}}"
}

### Who am I (copy the id) -> 200
# @name me
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/person/get

@studentId = {{me.response.body.$.id}}

### CREATE a text submission on the test assignment -> 201
# @name submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/submit/{{assignmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submitterId": {{studentId}},
  "isGroup": false,
  "content": { "type": "text", "text": "Today I learned how REST Client keeps cookies between requests." },
  "comment": "submitted from api/assignments_gradebook.http"
}

@submissionId = {{submission.response.body.$.id}}

### Submit with the wrong content type -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/submit/{{assignmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submitterId": {{studentId}},
  "isGroup": false,
  "content": { "type": "link", "url": "https://example.com" }
}

### READ own submissions -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/getSubmissions/{{studentId}}

### READ own gradebook card -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students/{{studentId}}

### Another student's card -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students/1

### Roster as a student -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students

### Own AI queue (only own entries, plus queueLength) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue

### Tracker as a student -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/tracker

### Create a test assignment as a student -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/test

### Grade-now as a student -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue/{{submissionId}}/grade-now

### Run the AI queue as a student -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue/run-now

### Grade own submission as a student -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/grade/{{submissionId}}?grade=1&feedback=self

### Delete the test assignment as a student -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/delete/{{assignmentId}}

### Delete own submission as a student -> 403 (only staff, creators and graders manage submissions)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### ---------- Admin again: grade, verify, clean up ----------

### Log in as admin -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "{{adminUid}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Grade the student's submission -> 200, needsAiRegrade false
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/grade/{{submissionId}}?grade=0.8&feedback=Graded%20from%20HTTP

### Grade above the assignment's points -> 200 today (no range check); /checks then flags "Grades in range"
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/grade/{{submissionId}}?grade=5

### Checks now report the out-of-range grade -> 200, "Grades in range" ok=false
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}/checks

### Put a valid grade back -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/grade/{{submissionId}}?grade=0.8&feedback=Graded%20from%20HTTP

### Student card as staff shows the grade and gradedAt -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/synergy/gradebook/students/{{studentId}}

### Grade-now on a submission that is not queued -> 409 not_queued
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/ai-queue/{{submissionId}}/grade-now

### DELETE the submission -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### DELETE the test assignment -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/delete/{{assignmentId}}

### READ after delete -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/assignments/{{assignmentId}}
